 ring lights and flowers\, titled “3rd Annual Maker’s Market.” It inc
 ludes event details for May 6th from 12–4 PM at the Student Community Ce
 nter. An illustration of a market booth with handmade items like clothing\
 , art\, and accessories represents student creatives and a festive market 
 atmosphere.
