BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The WRRC Presents: The Davis Feminist Film Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T193000
UID:1b82b9702c947f550832fb82bfe01b60572026_5:36:34_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:The WRRC Presents: The Davis Feminist Film Festival\n\n\nPleas
 e join us Saturday May 9th for our annual Davis Feminist Film Festival. We
  are delighted to share our theme this year is Fruitful: Cultivating Commu
 nity as Resistance. We received over 1\,200 films from all over the world 
 and selected 21 films to screen at the event. \n\nAs we grapple with the 
 atrocities across the world and daily reminders of rapid climate disasters
  we are reminded of how important community building is. By leaning on and
  cultivating community we hope to resist\, find joy\, grieve and learn tog
 ether. This year’s films utilize an intersectional feminist lens and inv
 ites us to come together and dream of a liberated future. \n\nPlease rese
 rve free tickets on Eventbrite\, which include snacks and refreshments. W
 e have a matinee showing from 11-2pm and an evening showing from 5-7pm. Ea
 ch showing has a different selection of films\, so we encourage you to joi
 n us for both. \nEveryone is welcome and we can’t wait to see you there
 !\n\nDate: Sat. May 9th\nTime: 11am and 5pm\n\nLocation: Student Community
  Center\, Multipurpose Room (2nd Floor)
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908787
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
